                "message": "Fix several CyCache issues.\n- The newest file was evicted instead of the oldest one. (#8089)\n-  Concurrent cache cleanup failed when multiple processes tried to remove the same file. (#7983)\n- The cleanup was essentially untested.\n- Cleanup testing was difficult due to file system state dependencies.\n\nCloses https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/8089\nCloses https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/7983\n\nTests were partly generated by Claude Haiku 4.5.",
